## ✅ UPLOAD INSTRUCTIONS

1. Go to: https://github.com/chefentangermark/3d-fighters-browser
2. Click **"Add file"** → **"Create new file"**
3. Create each file with exact name (including path like `src/js/controls.js`)
4. Paste the content
5. Click **"Commit new file"**
6. Repeat for all 10 files

**Your complete 3D Fighters game will be uploaded!** 🎮⚔️
